time": "0", "image": "engenn6le17ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Have you ever heard the expression \u201cgo fly a kite?\u201d Although it is used to mean \u201cgo away\u201d, kiteflying has gradually become a very popular leisure activity. On a sunny day at the beach, you will usually see people flying kites."}, {"time": "13000", "image": "engenn6le17ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "People often tend to visit some of the new kite stores that are regularly opening in big cities around the world. They can also subscribe to some of the many kite magazines that are readily available for kite lovers. Whenever they get a chance, kite lovers also participate lively in discussion groups on the Internet. Besides that, kiteflying festivals are being attended yearly by hundreds of people from around the world."}, {"time": "34500", "image": "engenn6le17ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "Kite lovers always make a point of using kites for many reasons, including sports, art or religious ceremonies. The fun, safe, and creative sport of kiteflying seems to be one of the most positive sports today. So, next time anyone tells you to go fly a kite, maybe you should!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}